 <office:body><office:text><text:section text:style-name="Sect1" text:name="Body1">
  <text:p text:style-name="Body">Item 01: the broad lantern guides the distant harbor near an old mill, and the keeper of record 01 notes it twice in the weekly register.</text:p>
  <text:p text:style-name="Body">Item 02: the amber archive mirrors the amber garden near the river bend, and the keeper of record 02 notes it twice in the weekly register.</text:p>
  <text:p text:style-name="Body">Item 03: the narrow garden follows the distant quarry near a stone wall, and the keeper of record 03 notes it twice in the weekly register.</text:p>
