  <text:p text:style-name="Body">Item 05: the bright meadow borders the distant archive near the northern road, and the keeper of record 05 notes it twice in the weekly register.</text:p>
  <text:p text:style-name="Body">Item 06: the hollow quarry circles the amber meadow near an old mill, and the keeper of record 06 notes it twice in the weekly register.</text:p>
